    "body": "Changing commit message per https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/master/TEAM.md\r\n\r\n> Prefix the summary line with \"Editorial: \" if the change is just to fix formatting, typos, or is a refactoring that does not change how the standard is understood. Note that bug fixes or clarifications are not editorial, even if they only affect non-normative text.",
